            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 86462,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak nazywa się zmienna licznika w tym kodzie?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"year = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" year &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2025\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;It's \" /><text value=\"{year}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  year += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's 2020\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2021\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2022\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2023\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2024\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2025\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>year</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">W kodzie nie ma zmiennej licznika</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>year</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 86470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest warunek tej pętli <code>while</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"year = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" year &lt;= \" /><text value=\"2025\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;It's \" /><text value=\"{year}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  year += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"It's 2020\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2021\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2022\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2023\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2024\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"It's 2025\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>year += 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>year &lt;= 2025</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>year = 2020</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>while</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>year &lt;= 2025</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 86467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>9</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>9</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>11</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Code in the code block",
            "id": 86471,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczby od <code>2</code> do <code>5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>2</code> do <code>4</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>5</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby od <code>2</code> do <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Changing the condition",
            "id": 86469,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trial = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" trial &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trial += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trial)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Counter variable",
            "id": 86500,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz zmienną licznika o nazwie <code>counter</code> i przypisz jej wartość <code>-1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"-1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>counter = -1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 86466,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmień warunek tak, aby sprawdzał, czy <code>number</code> jest mniejsze niż <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(number)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  number += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>&lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 86464,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Powtórz blok kodu w pętli <code>while</code> 4 razy, przypisując wartość do zmiennej <code>i</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  i += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 86461,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zapobiegaj nieskończonej pętli, zwiększając zmienną <code>evens</code> o <code>2</code> w bloku kodu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"evens = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" evens &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  evens += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(evens)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>evens</code>, następnie <code>+=</code> i na końcu <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
